    "method": "48 fresh FineWeb rows (cl.fineweb_rows(48)), leaf bundle ablated via cl.proj_hooks(top_probes), dCE = ce_sweep(hooks,tok)-ce_sweep((),tok); dissociation = mean(dCE at capitalized targets) - mean(dCE elsewhere)",
